Optional scanner support builds SANE magicolor 1.4.0 from its official source
archive and applies our profile patch. That upstream component is GPL-2.0-only,
copyright Reinhold Kainhofer and other SANE contributors, based on epson2 and
earlier SANE work. Its original notices and COPYING remain in the downloaded
source. The corresponding original source and our patch are needed if anyone
redistributes a built scanner library. No SANE scanner binary is bundled in
this project's source archive.
